    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brophy Estates present No 34 Milton Hall which is a  spacious, light filled first floor apartment, located in this most sought after complex on Dublin Road, a short stroll to Swords town centre and convenient to all local amenities and services. \r\n\r\nThis modern apartment is boasts floor to ceiling windows in the living area maximizing natural light and creating an airy feel. There is one designated car space in the underground car park with remote access. \r\n\r\nAccommodation briefly comprises; hall, bathroom, two double bedrooms both with access to the balcony, bright and spacious open plan kitchen/living room and balcony access. The property overlooks Dublin Road to the front and the playing pitches at the rear. Located immediate to Swords village within minutes walk to Pavilion Shopping Centre and the Main Street, Swords. \r\n\r\nThere are numerous local amenities including shops, restaurants, bars, both primary and secondary school, créche, gyms, parks and sporting facilities. On your doorstep there are frequent running bus routes including the Swords Express which has direct access to Dublin city centre. \r\n\r\nThe property is within a short drive to Airside Retail Park, Dublin Airport and the M50/M1 Motorways.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION \r\n\r\nEntrance hall Foyer – 2.6 x 1.88m, Internal hall – 1.21 x 2.69m.  Laminate flooring, hot press with foam insulated boiler, separate storage press, alarm pad, intercom. \r\n\r\nLiving / kitchen / dining room Kitchen (1.75 x 3.43m), Living Room (4.61 x 4.53m) Large open plan living room, tv point wall to ceiling glass panel doors leading balcony.\r\n\r\nKitchen – Plentiful storage, Integrated oven, Hob, Extractor.  \r\n\r\nBalcony  - 1.6 x 4.26m. \r\n\r\nBathroom 2.06m X 1.74m w.c. & w.h.b. Electric shower, tiled floor, tiled over bath part wall mirror and shaving light, extractor fan \r\n\r\nBedroom (1) 4.10 x 2.84n built in wardrobes, laminate flooring, double glazed French door to private balcony \r\n\r\nBedroom (2) 4.09 x 2.47m built in wardrobes, laminate flooring, double glazed French aluminium door to private balcony \r\n\r\nOutside, there is communal surface parking and a designated car space in the secure underground car park accessible by serviced lift."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Excellent town centre location Minutes walk to an abundance of amenities\r\nBalcony access from both bedrooms\r\nWest facing rear balcony\r\nBuilt in wardrobes\r\nTwo double bedrooms\r\nWood grain double glazed windows and doors\r\nAnnual management fee €2,127"
      },
      {
